{"caption":"The video captures a small cylindrical metal burner resting on a tiered base atop a dark wooden table, set against a red brick wall. A flame burns continuously from the burner's top, anchored by a blue ring at its base and a yellow-white body rising above it. To the right sits a round black digital device whose screen shows changing numeric readouts above a lit green button and a blue dot.

Throughout the excerpt the flame flickers and reshapes, alternating between tall columnar plumes and shorter conical tongues. At moments the yellow body shrinks to a small tip above the blue ring before growing again. A buoyant yellow-orange puff periodically separates from the flame's tip, drifting upward through the frame as a detached blob.

The blue base ring and the small jets around the burner rim remain present the whole time. The burner, the device, the table, and the wall hold fixed screen positions with no camera movement.","length_note":""}
